<div class="textbox__content">
<ul>
<li>In addition to the web version, this book is available in a number of file formats, including PDF, EPUB (for eReaders), and various editable files. The Digital PDF has passed the Adobe Accessibility Check.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
