<li>4) Kuhnlein, H. V., &amp; Turner, N. J. (1991). <em data-start="428" data-end="511">Traditional plant foods of Canadian Indigenous peoples: Nutrition, botany and use</em>. Gordon and Breach Science Publishers.</li>
<li>5) Svedström, U., Vuorela, H., Kostiainen, R., Tuominen, J., Kokkonen, J., Rauha, J.-P., Laakso, I., &amp; Hiltunen, R. (2002). Isolation and identification of oligomeric procyanidins from <em data-start="746" data-end="757">Crataegus</em> leaves and flowers. <em data-start="778" data-end="798">Phytochemistry, 60</em>(8), 821–825. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/S0031-9422(02)00172-3" data-start="812" data-end="857">https://doi.org/10.1016/S0031-9422(02)00172-3</a></li>
<li>6) Dahmer, S., &amp; Scott, E. (2010). Health effects of hawthorn. <em data-start="922" data-end="953">American Family Physician, 81</em>(4), 465–468.</li>
