<li>Picman, A. K. (1986). Biological activities of sesquiterpene lactones. <em>Biochemical Systematics and Ecology, 14</em>(3), 255–281. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/0305-1978(86)90101-8">https://doi.org/10.1016/0305-1978(86)90101-8</a></li>
<li>Rodriguez, E., Towers, G. H. N., &amp; Mitchell, J. C. (1976). Biological activities of sesquiterpene lactones. <em>Phytochemistry, 15</em>(11), 1573–1580. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/S0031-9422(00)97430-2">https://doi.org/10.1016/S0031-9422(00)97430-2</a></li>
