<p>11) USDA, Natural Resources Conservation Service. (2025). <em>Plant profile: Erigeron compositus</em> Pursh (cutleaf daisy). <a href="https://plants.usda.gov/plant-profile/ERCO4?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_new" rel="noopener">https://plants.usda.gov/plant-profile/ERCO4</a> (Retrieved September 24, 2025)</p>
