<p>7) Plants For A Future. (n.d.). <em>Leymus condensatus – Giant wild rye.</em> PFAF Plant Database. <a href="https://pfaf.org/user/Plant.aspx?LatinName=Leymus+condensatus&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_new" rel="noopener">https://pfaf.org/user/Plant.aspx?LatinName=Leymus+condensatus</a> <a href="https://pfaf.org/user/Plant.aspx?LatinName=Leymus+condensatus" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pfaf</a></p>
