<p>8) S. Department of Agriculture, Natural Resources Conservation Service. (2025). <em>Koeleria macrantha (Ledeb.) Schult.</em> <a href="https://plants.usda.gov/home/plantProfile?symbol=KOMA" target="_new" rel="noopener">https://plants.usda.gov/home/plantProfile?symbol=KOMA</a> <a href="https://plants.usda.gov/plant-profile/KOMA?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">plants.usda.gov</a></p>
