<p>3) Wang, B.-L., Ge, Z.-K., Qiu, J.-R., Luan, S.-Q., Hao, X.-C., &amp; Zhao, Y.-H. (2024). Sedum <em>aizoon</em>: A review of its history, traditional uses, nutritional value, botany, phytochemistry, pharmacology, toxicology, and quality control. <em>Frontiers in Pharmacology, 15</em>, 1349032. <a href="https://doi.org/10.3389/fphar.2024.1349032">https://doi.org/10.3389/fphar.2024.1349032</a></p>
