<p>6) (n.d.). <em>Sedum—An overview.</em> ScienceDirect Topics. <a href="https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics/agricultural-and-biological-sciences/sedum" target="_new" rel="noopener">https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics/agricultural-and-biological-sciences/sedum</a></p>
<p>7) Chevé-Kools, E., Gentelet, F., Morais Fernandes, J., Zucolotto, S. M., Ruprich-Robert, G., Chapeland-Leclerc, F., &amp; Grougnet, R. (2025, July 3). Nitrogen-containing metabolites in the Crassulaceae family: Structures, biological activities, occurrence and phylogeny. <em>Phytochemistry Reviews.</em> <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/s11101-025-10139-0">https://doi.org/10.1007/s11101-025-10139-0</a></p>
