<p>3) Gaïan EthnoBotany. (2017, June 28). <em>Lomatium macrocarpum</em>. <a href="https://gaianethnobotany.com/2017/06/01/lomatium-macrocarpum/" target="_new" rel="noopener">https://gaianethnobotany.com/2017/06/01/lomatium-macrocarpum/</a></p>
<p>4) Healthy Planet Canada. (2025, May 26). <em>A powerful antiviral herb: Desert parsley</em>. <a href="https://www.healthyplanetcanada.com/blog/a-powerful-antiviral-herb-desert-parsley/" target="_new" rel="noopener">https://www.healthyplanetcanada.com/blog/a-powerful-antiviral-herb-desert-parsley/</a></p>
