<p>11) University of Illinois Chicago Heritage Garden. (2025). <em>Nodding onion (Allium cernuum).</em> <a href="http://heritagegarden.uic.edu/nodding-onion" target="_new" rel="noopener">http://heritagegarden.uic.edu/nodding-onion</a></p>
<p>12) University of Wisconsin–Madison Division of Extension. (2025). <em>Nodding onion (Allium cernuum).</em> <a href="https://hort.extension.wisc.edu/articles/nodding-onion-allium-cernuum/" target="_new" rel="noopener">https://hort.extension.wisc.edu/articles/nodding-onion-allium-cernuum/</a></p>
<p>13) Splitrock Environmental [Internet]. Smooth Sumac Nodding Onion (kwela’wa úl). Lillooet (BC). [Accessed December 7th 2024]. <a href="https://splitrockenvironmental.ca/collections/plants/products/nodding-onion-kwela-wa-ul?variant=40368052076710">https://splitrockenvironmental.ca/collections/plants/products/nodding-onion-kwela-wa-</a> <a href="https://splitrockenvironmental.ca/collections/plants/products/nodding-onion-kwela-wa-ul?variant=40368052076710">ul?variant=40368052076710</a></p>
<p>14) Sharifi-Rad J, Mnayer D, Tabanelli G, Stojanovic-Radic ZZ, Sharifi-Rad M, Yousaf Z, Vallone L, Setzer WN, Iriti 2016. Plants of the genus Allium as antibacterial agents: From tradition to pharmacy. Cell Mol Biol. 62(9). <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/27585263/">https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/27585263/</a></p>
<p>15) Gorrepati K, Krishna R, Singh S, Shirsat DV, Soumia PS, Mahajan 2024. Harnessing the Nutraceutical and Therapeutic Potential of Allium spp: Current Insights and Future Directions. Front Nutr. 11. doi: <a href="https://doi.org/10.3389/fnut.2024.1497953">10.3389/fnut.2024.1497953</a></p>
</section>
