<p>8) S. Department of Agriculture, Natural Resources Conservation Service. (2025). <em>Rocky Mountain juniper plant guide.</em> <a href="https://plants.usda.gov/DocumentLibrary/plantguide/pdf/pg_jusc2.pdf" target="_new" rel="noopener">https://plants.usda.gov/DocumentLibrary/plantguide/pdf/pg_jusc2.pdf</a></p>
