<p>5) Kula, M., Majda, T., &amp; Góra, J. (2018). Chemical composition of the essential oils from the roots of <em>Erigeron acris</em> and <em>Erigeron annuus.</em> <em>Molecules, 23</em>(11), 2948. <a href="https://doi.org/10.3390/molecules23112948">https://doi.org/10.3390/molecules23112948</a></p>
