<p>8) (2025). <em>Erigeron – An overview.</em> <em>ScienceDirect Topics.</em> <a href="https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics/agricultural-and-biological-sciences/erigeron" target="_new" rel="noopener">https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics/agricultural-and-biological-sciences/erigeron</a></p>
<p>9) Bhatnagar, N., &amp; Kaur, R. (2023). Harnessing unexplored medicinal values of <em>Erigeron bonariensis.</em> <em>South African Journal of Botany, 157,</em> 445–456. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.sajb.2023.02.019">https://doi.org/10.1016/j.sajb.2023.02.019</a></p>
