<p>11) Wildflower Center of Southwest USA. (2025). <em>Showy daisy (Erigeron speciosus).</em> <a href="https://www.americansouthwest.net/plants/wildflowers/erigeron-speciosus.html" target="_new" rel="noopener">https://www.americansouthwest.net/plants/wildflowers/erigeron-speciosus.html</a></p>
</section>
