<p>8) Jensen, S. R., &amp; Nielsen, B. J. (1981). Iridoid and other glycosides from <em>Penstemon</em> <em>Phytochemistry, 20</em>(12), 2753–2756. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/0031-9422(81)80031-U">https://doi.org/10.1016/0031-9422(81)80031-U</a></p>
