<p>11) (2024, December 7). <em>Penstemon fruticosus.</em> <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penstemon_fruticosus" target="_new" rel="noopener">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penstemon_fruticosus</a></p>
