<p>6) Mercier, B., Prost, J., &amp; Prost, M. (2009). The essential oil of turpentine and its major volatile fraction (α- and β-pinenes): A review. <em data-start="1080" data-end="1157">International Journal of Occupational Medicine and Environmental Health, 22</em>(4), 331–342. <a href="https://doi.org/10.2478/v10001-009-0032-5" data-start="1171" data-end="1212">https://doi.org/10.2478/v10001-009-0032-5</a></p>
